= Instructions

Shake all ingredients: @Rum{2 oz}, fresh @Lime juice{1/2 oz}, @Maple syrup{1/2 oz} and 
strain into a #Rocks glass{} without ice. 

Top with @Angostura Aromatic Bitters foam{} and add a light dusting of @Cayenne pepper{}.